<p>
  Hello,
</p>

<p>
  <strong><%= @minor.name || @minor.email %></strong> invited you to be their
  parent or guardian on Fuime, a financial platform for teen-run businesses.
</p>

<p>
  If you accept, you will be the legal signer and responsible adult for their
  venture. You will be able to see their transactions and you will receive
  important notifications about the account. They run the venture day to day.
</p>

<p>
  Review the invitation and the guardian agreement here:
</p>

<p>
  <%= link_to "Review guardian invitation", @accept_url,
              style: "display:inline-block;background:#2242FF;color:#ffffff;padding:12px 20px;text-decoration:none;border-radius:8px;font-weight:600;" %>
</p>

<p style="word-break: break-all;">
  Or paste this link into your browser:<br>
  <%= link_to @accept_url, @accept_url %>
</p>

<p>
  If you did not expect this invitation, or if you do not know
  <%= @minor.name || @minor.email %>, you can ignore this email. Nothing
  happens unless you accept.
</p>

<p>
  Questions? Reply to this email or write to <%= @support_email %>.
</p>

<p>
  Thanks,<br>
  The Fuime team
</p>
